{"version":1,"content":"<p>【極限挑戰 😱】大家也知道，Microsoft Windows 11 的官方最低規格是 4GB 記憶體，但實際上就算用 8GB 也未必順暢，根本就是騙人！</p><p>然而知名精簡版系統開發者 NTDEV 再次刷新外界對 Windows 11 的認知，成功將 Windows 11 系統精簡至僅需 128MB 記憶體即可開機並進入系統運作，佔用量僅為官方最低需求約 1/32，實在太誇張了吧。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T18:20:44.330165+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T18:06:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T20:38:14.176885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T18:18:13.172940+00:00","content_hash":"0528889cf2f235b290cd4288c62a15f1c94a8b5e9c6e68bed669dc78727f856e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}